{"title": "Man's Best Friend", "pageid": 28230, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Man's_Best_Friend", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Companions_Bond.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/58/Companions_Bond.webp/300px-Companions_Bond.webp, /w/images/5/58/Companions_Bond.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/58/Companions_Bond.webp/300px-Companions_Bond.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/58/Companions_Bond.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Man's Best Friend</b> is a passive feature which boosts the offence and defence of a hunting dog, according to the proficiency bonus of their master.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>This hunting dog's <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\">Armour Class</a> and damage increase by an amount equal to the <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Proficiency Bonus\">Proficiency Bonus</a> of its houndmaster. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Gordis\" title=\"Gordis\">Gordis</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Pol\" title=\"Pol\">Pol</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Rocky\" title=\"Rocky\">Rocky</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Zina\" title=\"Zina\">Zina</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>This passive feature is actually two-in-one: a variant for <a href=\"/wiki/Houndmaster_Pol\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Houndmaster Pol\">Houndmaster Pol</a> that adds his proficiency bonus to the dogs, and a variant for the dogs that receives the proficiency bonus. Both of these conditions are named <b>Man's Best Friend.</b></li></ul>\n</div>     \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714203143\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.024 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.028 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 456/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2269/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1871/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 10/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 256/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.003/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 643670/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   24.091      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   24.091      1 -total\n 37.64%    9.067      1 Template:Main_namespace_only\n 18.15%    4.373      1 Template:PageSeo\n 16.49%    3.973      1 Template:Hidden_code\n 14.62%    3.522      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n 10.96%    2.641      3 Template:IfEmpty\n  8.66%    2.085      1 Template:Passive_creatures_list\n  6.62%    1.596      1 Template:Passive_equipment_list\n  1.36%    0.328      1 Template:Clear\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:28230-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714203143 and revision id 168448. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}